## 4. Emergency Response Testing

The emergency-response concept was evaluated through controlled testing of the relevant prototype mechanisms.

The testing included:

- SOS activation
- Sensor-based event detection
- Wearable-to-Boat Hub communication
- Emergency information transmission
- Location information
- Flotation response
- Rudder actuator response

